t message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 3; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-14 09:00: Got it, Hollis. I've saved Idris Brevik as your go-to escalation contact at Tansley Parcel for the Marlowe rollout. I kept it private to you, so it won't come up for anyone else.\n```","id":3,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 11; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nHollis Mbeki (hollis-mbeki, Central team lead) wrote in a direct message with assistant on 2026-10-21 09:00: I need to escalate a Tansley Parcel problem today. Who should I call?\n```","id":11,"source":"hollis-mbeki, a direct message with assistant, 2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 7; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: Got it, Hollis. I'll remember that Soren Tolland is your go-to contact at Tansleigh Packaging for Bittern rollout escalations, and I've confirmed that in our DM. The brain saves what you tell me in our DMs where only you can see it, so I'll have this when you ask about it later. I won't mention it in anyone else's conversations or in channels.\n```","id":7,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 6; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in a direct message with hollis-mbeki on 2026-10-16 17:00: Got it, Hollis. Soren Tolland is your go-to escalation contact at Tansleigh Packaging for the Bittern rollout. Our DMs are saved privately to you, so I'll have this on hand whenever you ask about it.\n```","id":6,"source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-16T17:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
