n 2026-10-14 09:00: Got it, Hollis. I've saved Idris Brevik as your go-to escalation contact at Tansley Parcel for the Marlowe rollout. I kept it private to you, so it won't come up for anyone else.\n```","id":3,"source_id":"private-hollis-mbeki","source":"assistant, a direct message with hollis-mbeki, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
{"seq":52,"trial_id":"v04-cal-r2-2026-11/openclaw-opus-gbrain-told-live-er-l3-mu-v04-dev/er-11-l3-tansley-parcel-contact/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-06T17:28:02.624Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-21T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"a38e6ef78c6dfd99b498ce6e376398c9c1381eeedb96495dc22d8b66a4e4f9d6","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","text":"Hi Hollis, on 14 Oct you told me here that your go-to escalation contact at Tansley Parcel (for the Marlowe rollout) is Idris Brevik, so he's the one to call. Quick check, since the names are close: Soren Tolland is the contact you gave me for Tansleigh Packaging (Bittern rollout), not Parcel. I don't have a phone number for Idris on file. Tansley Parcel is also Pree's account, so you may want to loop her in, or use #inc-tansley-carrier-api if this is an outage."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV04CAL0001","ts":"1792591200.000133"}}
